title FLOW 2B (TO-BE) — Multi-Channel Debt Settlement & AR Clearance (FE-08 & FE-17)

|Customer|
|Cashier / POS Staff|
|MT-GRMS System|

|Customer|
start
:Visit store or open app\nto settle past debt;

|Cashier / POS Staff|
:Search customer in FE-08;\nView unpaid debt invoices;

|MT-GRMS System|
:Display outstanding balance\n& invoice breakdown;

|Customer|
if (Selected Repayment Channel?) then (Physical Cash at Counter)
  :Hand over cash to cashier;
  |Cashier / POS Staff|
  :Count cash & deposit into till;\nConfirm receipt on screen;
  |MT-GRMS System|
  :Create Cash Receipt in FE-17;\nAdd to branch till balance;
else (Dynamic VietQR Transfer)
  |Cashier / POS Staff|
  :Select "Pay via VietQR";
  |MT-GRMS System|
  :Generate Dynamic VietQR with\nembedded invoice & customer ID;
  |Customer|
  :Scan QR using banking app\n& authorize payment;
  |MT-GRMS System|
  :Receive Bank Webhook;\nCreate Bank Receipt in FE-17;
endif

|MT-GRMS System|
:Deduct AR debt balance (FE-08);\nMark debt invoices as "Settled";\nRestore customer credit limit;

|Cashier / POS Staff|
:Print / send electronic\nsettlement confirmation;

|Customer|
stop
@enduml

