title FLOW 3 (AS-IS) — Unregulated Operations, Blind Tax Assessment & Penalties

|Store Owner|
|Tax Authority / Banking Audit|

|Store Owner|
start
:Operate retail business\nacross multiple branches\nwithout accounting software;
:Commingle personal and\nbusiness cash in private\nbank account & drawers;
:Track daily sales in paper\nnotebooks or discard receipts;

|Tax Authority / Banking Audit|
:Audit personal banking\ninflows & cross-check local\ne-invoice platforms;
:Issue formal inspection notice;\nDemand 3-year revenue &\nexpense accounting books;

|Store Owner|
:Attempt to gather loose\npaper invoices & notes;

if (Can present valid VAT\ninvoices & statutory ledgers?) then (Yes - Full records)
  :Submit paper receipts\nfor official audit review;
else (No - Missing / Lost records)
  |Tax Authority / Banking Audit|
  :Reject undocumented expenses;\nImpose arbitrary presumed\nrevenue assessment;
  :Retroactively tax full revenue;\nLevy 20% penalty + 0.03%/day\nlate payment interest charge;
  |Store Owner|
  :Accept severe financial loss;\nPay heavy penalties;\nDeplete business profit;
endif

|Store Owner|
stop
@enduml

