title FLOW 3 (TO-BE) — Tax Threshold Monitoring & Statutory Ledger Export (FE-10 & FE-19)

|Store Owner|
|MT-GRMS System (FE-10 & FE-19)|
|Local Storage / Accountant|

|Store Owner|
start
:Access Tax & Accounting\nModule (FE-19) at period end;

|MT-GRMS System (FE-10 & FE-19)|
:Consolidate multi-branch sales,\nCOGS, OpEx (FE-07) & Payroll;\nCompute Year-to-Date (YTD) Revenue;

if (YTD Revenue <= 1B VND?\n(Group 1 - Tax Exempt)) then (Yes)
  :Set Status: Tax-Exempt;\nGenerate simple ledger S1a-HKD;\n(Alert if YTD > 850M threshold);
else (No - Revenue > 1B)
  if (YTD Revenue <= 3B VND?\n(Group 2 - Single Store)) then (Yes)
    :Display e-invoice compliance alert;\nPrepare statutory ledgers based on\nselected method (% vs Profit 15%);
  else (No - Group 3: > 3B Chains)
    :Lock Method: Profit-based (17%);\nPackage complete 6 statutory ledgers:\nS2a, S2b, S2c, S2d, S2e, S3a;
  endif
endif

:Display consolidated tax dashboard\n& pre-packaged statutory records;

|Store Owner|
:Review multi-branch P&L (FE-10)\n& inspect audited cost ledger;
:Click "Export Statutory\nAccounting Ledger Package";

|MT-GRMS System (FE-10 & FE-19)|
:Generate standardized Excel & PDF\nfiles (Circular 88/2021/TT-BTC)\nembedded with Digital Audit Hash;

|Local Storage / Accountant|
:Download official ledger bundle\nto local workstation / cloud;\nArchive for tax audit & records;
stop
@enduml
